~30 root-level ad-hoc scripts and the old tests/ suite call the removed API and would now fail. quarantine_stale_scripts.ps1 moves them aside using explicit filename lists — not globs, so it won't sweep up the new suite. _deprecated_scripts/README.md documents the API migration.

In their place, tests/test_core.py — 50+ real unit tests for the deterministic core. This is the first thing in the project that can be verified without model weights, so run it first:

